    "finalName": "",
    "description": "As a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a>, you can designate a single target creature as the focus of your attentions. You gain a +2 bonus to your Speed any time you spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a> to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move\" title=\"Move\">Move</a>, provided that you end your movement adjacent to the target.<br><br>You retain this bonus (and may not use this Talent again) until your target surrenders, is reduced to 0 Hit Points, moves to the bottom of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>, or until the encounter ends.",
